WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.229 line:8%
Open Reports, choose the date range and apply it.

00:00:04.229 --> 00:00:06.578 line:8%
Select the report to export.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:13.938 line:8%
Keep identifiers masked unless an authorised full-identifier export is specifically required.

00:00:14.954 --> 00:00:21.376 line:8%
Choose Download PDF for reading or printing, or Download CSV for a spreadsheet.

00:00:21.376 --> 00:00:25.822 line:8%
Prepare large CSV handles longer exports with progress checking.
